def author(c,s,m,a):
 def craft(cid,intro,events,facts,codes,marks):
  z,e=intro.split('~');zh=' '.join(v.split('~')[0] for y,v in events);en=' '.join(v.split('~')[1] for y,v in events)
  m(cid,history=z+zh+'這些年份是技術出版節點，不代表某座壩的施工年表。課程從公開工法建立原創算例，地標僅用於對照不同壩型與環境；每項材料參數、荷載和允許條件仍需依工程調查與專案設計重新確定。~'+e+' '+en+' These years mark technical publications rather than construction events at a particular dam. The course develops original calculations from public engineering principles. Landmarks compare dam types and settings; material parameters, loads and admissible conditions still require project investigations and specific design. The examples do not assert that an unverified technique was used at a named structure.',timeline=[{'year':y,'event':v} for y,v in events],facts=facts,codes=codes,landmarks=marks,place={'name':'丹佛壩工技術教育參照點~Denver dam-engineering educational reference','country':'美國~United States','lat':39.72,'lng':-105.13,'query':'Bureau of Reclamation Technical Service Center Denver Colorado'})
 gravity=[('1976','美國墾務局出版重力壩設計專書，提供施工與結構整合背景。~Reclamation publishes Design of Gravity Dams, providing integrated construction and structural context.'),('1995','美國工兵團重力壩設計手冊出版，整理荷載與穩定分析。~USACE publishes Gravity Dam Design guidance for loading and stability analysis.'),('2000','碾壓混凝土手冊出版，提供不同大體積澆築方法的比較。~The RCC manual is published, enabling comparison with other mass-concrete placement methods.')]
 embank=[('2011','反濾層標準章節更新，聚焦顆粒保持與區域界面。~The protective-filter standard is updated, emphasizing particle retention and zone interfaces.'),('2012','土石壩設計與施工章節更新，連結材料、填築與品質控制。~Embankment design and construction chapters are updated to connect materials, placement and quality control.'),('2014','滲流與監測章節更新，提供服役水壓及行為判讀背景。~Seepage and monitoring chapters are updated, supporting interpretation of service pressures and behavior.')]
 gc=['美國工兵團重力壩設計手冊，EM 1110-2-2200，1995~USACE Gravity Dam Design, EM 1110-2-2200, 1995','美國墾務局重力壩設計專書，1976~Reclamation Design of Gravity Dams, 1976']
 ec=['美國墾務局土石壩設計標準，第十三號第二章，2012~Reclamation Design Standards No. 13, Chapter 2: Embankment Design, 2012','美國墾務局土石壩施工標準，第十三號第十章，2012~Reclamation Design Standards No. 13, Chapter 10: Embankment Construction, 2012']
 craft('b231','重力壩分塊澆築把供料、溫控和接縫安排結合，讓施工階段留下的初始條件成為長期結構行為的一部分。~Block-by-block gravity-dam construction connects supply, temperature control and joints, making construction initial conditions part of the long-term structural response.',gravity,['教學膠結材放熱與熱容量得到18.75 K絕熱溫升。~Teaching binder heat and thermal capacity give adiabatic rise 18.75 K.','教學600 m³澆塊含停頓需9.5 h。~A teaching 600 m³ block including an outage requires 9.5 h.','教學層面黏聚摩擦抗力22 MN。~Teaching joint cohesion-friction resistance is 22 MN.','教學2 m熱擴散尺度對應46.30 days。~Teaching two-metre diffusion scale corresponds to 46.30 days.','教學冷卻迴路一天移除3.61152 GJ熱量。~The teaching cooling circuit removes 3.61152 GJ in one day.','教學基底純摩擦抗力比1.575，非規範安全係數。~The teaching friction-only resistance ratio is 1.575, not a code safety factor.'],gc,['胡佛壩：大體積混凝土背景比較~Hoover Dam: mass-concrete context comparison','Hungry Horse壩：拱壩型式比較~Hungry Horse Dam: arch-dam type comparison'])
 craft('b232','碾壓混凝土把土工式鋪層碾壓和水泥水化材料結合，品質核心由單一強度轉為材料、壓實與層面連續性的共同證據。~RCC combines earthwork-style lift compaction with cement hydration, shifting quality evidence from strength alone toward materials, compaction and interlift continuity.',gravity,['教學1500 m³薄層以250 m³/h供應需6 h。~A teaching 1500 m³ lift at 250 m³/h requires 6 h.','教學乾密度比得到96.667%密實度，非接受標準。~Teaching dry-density ratio gives 96.667 percent compaction, not an acceptance standard.','教學自由水修正後外加水75 kg/m³。~Teaching free-moisture correction leaves added water 75 kg/m³.','教學名義壓實能量密度400 kJ/m³。~Teaching nominal compaction energy density is 400 kJ/m³.','教學異向層狀垂直滲透率1.9802×10⁻⁸ m/s。~Teaching layered perpendicular permeability is 1.9802×10⁻⁸ m/s.','教學常態第五百分位強度15.065 MPa，非設計值。~Teaching normal fifth-percentile strength is 15.065 MPa, not a design value.'],['美國工兵團碾壓混凝土手冊，EM 1110-2-2006，2000~USACE Roller-Compacted Concrete, EM 1110-2-2006, 2000',gc[0]],['胡佛壩：傳統混凝土比較~Hoover Dam: conventional-concrete comparison','Hungry Horse壩：薄拱型式比較~Hungry Horse Dam: arch-form comparison'])
 craft('b233','雙曲拱壩把壩體與兩岸岩體當作共同承載系統，拱座調查和三維變形相容比單看混凝土壓應力更能揭露控制條件。~A double-curvature arch dam and its abutment rock act as one load-bearing system. Abutment investigation and three-dimensional compatibility reveal controls beyond concrete compression alone.',[('1977','墾務局修訂拱壩與重力壩設計準則，提供兩種傳力方式比較。~Reclamation revises arch and gravity design criteria, comparing distinct load-transfer systems.'),('1994','工兵團拱壩設計手冊出版，整理設計、分析與施工背景。~USACE publishes Arch Dam Design, covering design, analysis and construction context.'),('1995','重力壩手冊出版，作岩基及穩定概念的對照。~Gravity Dam Design is published as a comparison for foundation and stability concepts.')],['教學薄圓拱膜壓應力5 MPa，未含彎曲。~Teaching thin circular-arch membrane compression is 5 MPa, excluding bending.','教學平行剛度分擔得到共同位移2 mm。~Teaching parallel stiffness sharing gives common displacement 2 mm.','教學20 MN推力法向分量17.3205 MN。~Teaching thrust 20 MN has normal component 17.3205 MN.','教學單面無黏聚滑動抗力比1.5405。~The teaching cohesionless single-plane resistance ratio is 1.5405.','教學裂隙三角壓力合力40 MN。~Teaching triangular joint-pressure resultant is 40 MN.','教學封拱後自由降溫收縮16 mm，非實際開縫量。~Teaching free cooling contraction is 16 mm, not actual joint opening.'],['美國工兵團拱壩設計手冊，EM 1110-2-2201，1994~USACE Arch Dam Design, EM 1110-2-2201, 1994','美國墾務局拱壩與重力壩設計準則，1977修訂~Reclamation Design Criteria for Concrete Arch and Gravity Dams, revised 1977'],['Hungry Horse壩：公開拱壩研究背景~Hungry Horse Dam: published arch-study context','胡佛壩：拱重力型式比較~Hoover Dam: arch-gravity comparison'])
 craft('b234','混凝土面板堆石壩把防滲和承載功能交給不同材料，面板、墊層、堆石與趾板必須在變形後仍保持相容與連續。~Concrete-face rockfill dams assign sealing and support to different materials. Facing, cushion, rockfill and plinth must remain compatible and continuous after deformation.',embank,['教學堆石孔隙率0.2222，未代表壓縮模數。~Teaching rockfill porosity is 0.2222, without specifying compressibility.','教學兩層累積壓縮0.19 m。~Teaching two-layer accumulated compression is 0.19 m.','教學面板曲率造成200 microstrain表面應變。~Teaching face curvature produces surface strain 200 microstrain.','教學接縫8 mm張開與6 mm剪移合量10 mm。~Teaching joint opening 8 mm and shear 6 mm give resultant 10 mm.','教學斜面靜水合力6131.25 kN/m。~Teaching inclined-face hydrostatic resultant is 6131.25 kN/m.','教學十年對數蠕變增量11.513 mm，非實測預測。~Teaching ten-year logarithmic creep increment is 11.513 mm, not a measured forecast.'],ec,['New Exchequer壩：面板施工照片背景~New Exchequer Dam: documented facing-placement context','胡佛壩：整體混凝土型式比較~Hoover Dam: monolithic-concrete comparison'])
 craft('b235','心牆土石壩依靠分區材料共同工作，防滲不等於各區都阻水；反濾保持、排水連通和心牆應力狀態共同決定缺陷是否會擴大。~Earth-core rockfill dams depend on coordinated zones rather than making every material impermeable. Filter retention, connected drainage and core stress together determine whether defects can progress.',embank,['教學均質完整心牆達西流量0.005 L/s。~Teaching homogeneous intact-core Darcy flow is 0.005 L/s.','教學乾土1000 t調整含水需加水40 t。~Teaching moisture adjustment for dry soil 1000 t needs 40 t water.','教學孔隙比0.5、含水率0.15得到飽和度0.81。~Teaching void ratio 0.5 and water content 0.15 give saturation 0.81.','教學局部應力折減後水壓差為−20 kPa，僅篩選。~Teaching reduced local stress-pressure difference is −20 kPa, a screening result only.','教學排水帶達西能力1 L/s，未含出口損失。~Teaching drain Darcy capacity is 1 L/s, excluding outlet losses.','教學施工總應力增100 kPa而有效應力僅增30 kPa。~Teaching total stress rises 100 kPa while effective stress rises only 30 kPa.'],[ec[0],'美國墾務局土石壩反濾層標準，第十三號第五章，2011~Reclamation Design Standards No. 13, Chapter 5: Protective Filters, 2011'],['Jordanelle壩：公開填築細節背景~Jordanelle Dam: published embankment-detail context','New Melones壩：堆石材料比較~New Melones Dam: rockfill-material comparison'])
 craft('b236','瀝青心牆以低滲透且可變形的材料連接堆石承載體，材料比例、黏彈反應與施工接觸必須共同驗證，不能只以單一密度指標判斷。~An asphalt core combines low permeability with deformation capacity inside a rockfill support body. Mixture proportions, viscoelastic response and construction contacts require joint assessment rather than one density criterion.',[('2012','墾務局土石壩施工與設計章節更新，提供分區填築的一般背景。~Reclamation updates embankment design and construction chapters, providing general zoned-placement context.'),('2016','瀝青心牆簡化材料模型研究出版，探討分析所需的材料描述。~A simplified asphalt-core material-model study is published, addressing descriptions needed for analysis.'),('2020','曲學與照壁山心牆研究出版，分別報告設計表現及施工速率個案。~Quxue and Zhaobishan core studies are published, reporting design performance and a construction-rate case.')],['教學每100 kg礦料加6 kg瀝青，總質量占比5.6604%。~Teaching binder six kilograms per hundred kilograms mineral gives total-mass fraction 5.6604 percent.','教學密度2450與2500 kg/m³對應2%空隙率。~Teaching densities 2450 and 2500 kg/m³ give two-percent air voids.','教學黏彈階躍模型20 s應變0.0008647。~Teaching viscoelastic step model gives strain 0.0008647 at twenty seconds.','教學10 m材料自由降溫收縮3 mm。~Teaching ten-metre material contracts freely by 3 mm during cooling.','教學施工層長200 m、厚0.25 m、寬0.6 m，體積30 m³。~Teaching lift length 200 m, thickness 0.25 m and width 0.6 m give volume 30 m³.','教學隨機獨立抽樣20次漏檢5%缺陷區的機率35.85%。~Twenty independent teaching samples miss a five-percent defect fraction with probability 35.85 percent.'],ec,['曲學壩：公開瀝青心牆研究個案~Quxue Dam: published asphalt-core study','照壁山壩：公開心牆施工速率個案~Zhaobishan Dam: published core-construction-rate case'])
 craft('b237','基礎帷幕灌漿把裂隙地質、漿液流變和水力驗證連在一起，耗漿量只是過程資料，真正的工程判斷還要追蹤空間連續與剩餘通水路徑。~Foundation curtain grouting connects fracture geology, grout rheology and hydraulic verification. Consumption is process evidence; engineering interpretation must also track spatial continuity and remaining conductive paths.',[('1976','墾務局重力壩設計專書提供岩基處理與結構整合背景。~Reclamation gravity-dam guidance provides context for foundation treatment and structural integration.'),('2014','土石壩設計標準的基礎灌漿章節更新，官方目錄列明版本。~The foundation-grouting chapter of embankment standards is updated, as documented by the official index.'),('2017','工兵團灌漿技術手冊出版，整理材料、處理與驗證背景。~USACE publishes Grouting Technology, organizing material, treatment and verification context.')],['教學裂隙開度0.1增至0.15 mm，理想流量比3.375。~Teaching aperture increase from 0.1 to 0.15 mm gives ideal flow ratio 3.375.','教學開度與d95粒徑比5，非通用可灌門檻。~Teaching aperture-to-d95 ratio is five, not a universal groutability threshold.','教學Bingham裂隙流動壓差尺度200 kPa，非注入設定。~Teaching Bingham fracture threshold scale is 200 kPa, not an injection setting.','教學高程及水壓修正後有效注入差544.3 kPa。~Teaching elevation and groundwater corrections give effective pressure difference 544.3 kPa.','教學60 m孔長固定偏斜2°造成2.094 m偏移。~Teaching sixty-metre hole deviating two degrees has offset 2.094 m.','教學五孔段流量按1 MPa線性標準化後，平均5.4 L/(min·m)、中位2 L/(min·m)，保留極端值位置；非直接滲透係數。~Five teaching stage flows, linearly normalized to 1 MPa, have mean 5.4 L/(min·m) and median 2 L/(min·m). Retain extreme-value locations; these are not direct permeability coefficients.'],['美國工兵團灌漿技術手冊，EM 1110-2-3506，2017~USACE Grouting Technology, EM 1110-2-3506, 2017','美國墾務局土石壩設計標準，第十三號第十五章基礎灌漿，2014~Reclamation Design Standards No. 13, Chapter 15: Foundation Grouting, 2014'],['胡佛壩：混凝土壩岩基問題比較~Hoover Dam: concrete-dam rock-foundation comparison','Jordanelle壩：土石壩分區系統比較~Jordanelle Dam: zoned-embankment system comparison'])
 craft('b238','排水廊道把深部水壓轉為可觀測流量，同時容納監測與集排水系統；判讀必須把孔壓、流量、出口水位與構造變形一起放進水力收支。~Drainage galleries connect deep pressures to observable discharge while housing monitoring and collection systems. Interpretation must combine pore pressure, flow, outlet level and structural deformation within a hydraulic balance.',[('1976','墾務局重力壩設計專書提供揚壓和排水監測背景。~Reclamation gravity-dam guidance provides context for uplift and drainage monitoring.'),('1987','混凝土壩監測手冊出版，官方目錄列明此技術文獻。~The Concrete Dam Instrumentation Manual is published, documented in the official technical catalog.'),('2014','接縫止水研究報告完成，說明滲漏與廊道維護的關聯。~A joint-waterstop research report is completed, explaining links between leakage and gallery maintenance.')],['教學線性阻力網路節點水頭18 m，排水不代表零壓。~Teaching linear resistance network gives node head 18 m rather than zero pressure.','教學分段揚壓積分4659.75 kN/m。~Teaching piecewise uplift integration gives 4659.75 kN/m.','教學等效半徑2.5 m、孔距6 m留下1 m幾何缺口。~Teaching influence radius 2.5 m and spacing six metres leave a one-metre geometric gap.','教學表觀排水導度下降40%，需排除邊界改變。~Teaching apparent drain conductance falls 40 percent, requiring boundary-condition checks.','教學12 m³集水容積在淨入流0.01 m³/s下20 min填滿。~Teaching storage twelve cubic metres fills in twenty minutes at net inflow 0.01 m³/s.','教學獨立標準不確定度2與3 kPa合成壓差3.606 kPa。~Teaching independent standard uncertainties two and three kPa combine to 3.606 kPa for a difference.'],[gc[0],'美國墾務局混凝土壩監測手冊，1987~Reclamation Concrete Dam Instrumentation Manual, 1987'],['胡佛壩：混凝土壩揚壓概念比較~Hoover Dam: concrete-dam uplift concept comparison','Hungry Horse壩：拱壩傳力與監測比較~Hungry Horse Dam: arch load-transfer and monitoring comparison'])
 craft('b239','壩體接縫灌漿把分開澆築的混凝土塊連成預定傳力系統，結構封拱與既有止水修復是不同目的，課程將兩者證據分開並比較水力與力學性能。~Dam-joint grouting connects separately placed blocks into an intended load-transfer system. Structural closure and repair of existing waterstops have different purposes; this course separates their evidence while comparing hydraulic and mechanical performance.',[('1976','重力壩設計專書出版，提供混凝土分塊與接縫背景。~Gravity-dam design guidance is published, providing context for concrete blocks and joints.'),('1994','工兵團拱壩設計手冊出版，提供封拱與三維傳力背景。~USACE arch-dam guidance is published, supporting closure and three-dimensional load-transfer context.'),('2017','工兵團灌漿技術手冊出版，作材料與驗證方法參照。~USACE Grouting Technology is published as a reference for materials and verification methods.')],['教學24 m混凝土塊降溫12 K，自由收縮2.88 mm。~A teaching twenty-four-metre block cooling twelve kelvin contracts freely by 2.88 mm.','教學1200 m²接縫平均開度2 mm，幾何體積2.4 m³。~Teaching joint area 1200 m² at two-millimetre aperture gives volume 2.4 m³.','教學理想縫寬0.3降至0.1 mm，層流減96.296%。~Teaching ideal gap decrease from 0.3 to 0.1 mm reduces laminar flow by 96.296 percent.','教學10 m靜止漿柱壓力差176.58 kPa。~Teaching stationary ten-metre grout column gives pressure difference 176.58 kPa.','教學薄層剛度200 GN/m，1 MN壓力造成5 micrometres壓縮。~Teaching layer stiffness 200 GN/m gives five micrometres compression under 1 MN.','教學壓力衰減時間常數50 s、半衰時間34.657 s。~Teaching pressure-decay time constant is fifty seconds and half-life 34.657 seconds.'],['美國工兵團拱壩設計手冊，EM 1110-2-2201，1994~USACE Arch Dam Design, EM 1110-2-2201, 1994','美國工兵團灌漿技術手冊，EM 1110-2-3506，2017~USACE Grouting Technology, EM 1110-2-3506, 2017'],['Hungry Horse壩：拱壩結構系統比較~Hungry Horse Dam: arch structural-system comparison','胡佛壩：大體積混凝土分塊概念比較~Hoover Dam: mass-concrete block concept comparison'])
 craft('b240','施工導流把暫時水工構造、洪水風險與永久工程施工階段連結，核心不是單一設計流量，而是每個轉換階段的水力能力、暴露時間與可驗證完成條件。~Construction diversion connects temporary hydraulic works, flood risk and permanent construction stages. Its core is not one discharge value but the capacity, exposure duration and verifiable completion conditions of each transition.',[('1976','重力壩設計專書提供水工建設與施工整合背景。~Gravity-dam design guidance provides context for integrating hydraulic works and construction.'),('1994','臨時圍堰與支撐開挖規劃規定發布，涵蓋風險與永久構造完整性。~Temporary-cofferdam and braced-excavation planning requirements are issued, covering risk and permanent-structure integrity.'),('2012','土石壩施工標準章節更新，提供導流和基坑施工的一般背景。~The embankment-construction standards chapter is updated, providing general diversion and excavation context.')],['教學年超越機率5%，三年獨立暴露至少一次機率14.2625%。~Teaching annual exceedance five percent gives three-year independent exposure probability 14.2625 percent.','教學矩形渠均勻流能力約57.701 m³/s，未含回水。~Teaching rectangular-channel uniform-flow capacity is about 57.701 m³/s, excluding backwater.','教學6 m直徑滿流隧洞摩阻損失約1.063 m。~Teaching six-metre full tunnel has friction loss about 1.063 m.','教學圍堰有效重429.12 kN/m，已扣三角揚壓。~Teaching cofferdam effective weight is 429.12 kN/m after triangular uplift.','教學洪峰超額歷線需暫存216000 m³。~Teaching excess flood hydrograph requires storage 216000 m³.','教學平行工序與後續驗證總工期26 days。~Teaching parallel tasks and subsequent verification require total duration 26 days.'],['美國工兵團臨時圍堰與支撐開挖規劃，ER 1110-2-8152，1994~USACE Planning and Design of Temporary Cofferdams and Braced Excavations, ER 1110-2-8152, 1994',ec[1]],['胡佛壩：大型混凝土壩施工環境比較~Hoover Dam: large concrete-dam construction-setting comparison','Jordanelle壩：土石壩施工環境比較~Jordanelle Dam: embankment construction-setting comparison'])
